  "decision": "Revision 5 remains immutable but cannot be archived as a complete delivery. Its actual P2 push (b40807f22a5032292d2f782a247a4b3a24d5bba7) has successful legacy command receipts on main and the task branch, but those retained receipts are T048_payload_push_receipt records without GitPushOperationEvidence lifecycle/deadline, typed per-query timestamps/IDs, raw GitHub API query snapshots, and remote-config digest. The retained R5 S19 row also omits E868 from its evidence-ID list although the E868 evidence row exists; R6 records that measured link gap and carries E868 into its current cumulative row. The C2 closing commit and its checks are preserved; fresh C2 normal-push lifecycles now show both approved refs at 357eca592cd980d8706ac090dc3ffb5dd09af0fe. The missing P2 history cannot be recovered exactly after the event. Revision 6 therefore starts from current C2, creates a new tracked P3 and records its push and CI with full lifecycle evidence. No R5 commit, receipt, or sealed history is rewritten.",
